&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;For reproducibility, include the Cua release or commit used in your experiments. Citation metadata is also available in &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;CITATION.cff&#34; &gt;&lt;code&gt;CITATION.cff&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
